## Story Description
Implement the Data Quality page (9-check scorecard with GREEN/AMBER/RED diagnostics) and the Recommendations page (savings opportunities with expandable calculation basis and Excel export). Both pages are central to the consulting delivery — the quality page proves data integrity and the recommendations page is the client deliverable.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Create file: frontend/src/components/dashboard/DiagnosticsCheckCard.tsx — shadcn Card: props {check_name: string, status: 'GREEN'|'AMBER'|'RED', value_pct: number, description: string}. Renders: colored left border (green/amber/red using Tailwind border-l-4 + conditional color class); status Badge (variant green/yellow/red); check_name as card title; value_pct formatted as percentage; description in muted text. No expandable section needed — keep it compact.
- Create file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/DataQualityPage.tsx — fetches /cube/diagnostics. Computes overall_score as weighted average: GREEN=100, AMBER=50, RED=0, averaged across all 9 checks. Renders: 1 large KpiCard showing overall_score as percentage with color (>=80 green, >=50 amber, <50 red); 3x3 grid of DiagnosticsCheckCard. Shows Skeleton while loading.
- Create file: frontend/src/components/dashboard/RecommendationCard.tsx — shadcn Card with: header showing rec type as Badge + confidence Badge (HIGH=green, MEDIUM=yellow, LOW=red); large estimated_impact_aud formatted as currency; context text (e.g. 'IT Equipment — 8 suppliers'); action text in body. Collapsible section (shadcn Collapsible) labeled 'Calculation Basis' showing: table with rows: Baseline Spend (formatCurrency(baseline_spend)), Addressability (formatPct(addressability_pct)), Addressable Baseline (formatCurrency(addressable_baseline)), Saving Rate (saving_pct !== null ? formatPct(saving_pct) : 'WACC formula'), Estimated Saving (formatCurrency(estimated_impact_aud)); narrative text in italic below the table if narrative is non-empty.
- Create file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/RecommendationsPage.tsx — fetches GET /recommendations. If 404 shows empty state with 'Run Recommendations Engine' button (calls POST /recommendations/run via useMutation, then invalidates query).
- RecommendationsPage renders: PortfolioSummary row — KpiCards: Total Identified Savings, Savings as % of Spend, Recommendation Count, and a 'Sanity Check' badge (green 'Passed' or red 'Warning — review results'); shadcn Tabs with one tab per lever type (only show tabs that have ≥1 recommendation); within each tab a list of RecommendationCard components sorted by estimated_impact_aud DESC; Confidence filter using shadcn ToggleGroup (All / HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW); 'Export to Excel' button.
- Excel export: import xlsx; on click, creates a workbook with one sheet 'Recommendations' with columns: Type, Context, Estimated Impact AUD, Confidence, Lever, Action, Baseline Spend, Addressability %, Addressable Baseline, Saving %, Narrative. Downloads as spendcube_recommendations_{client_name}_{date}.xlsx.
