Implement the internal analyst review workstation as an admin-only page. Only accessible when engagement.is_admin is true (checked in Layout.tsx nav guard). Provides the supplier match review queue, category override management, and full audit trail — equivalent to dashboard/pages/99_admin_review_workstation.py from v1.

